            },
            {
                "progress":34,
                "logText":"Hofala, the cook from Guynmart, refused to make a pot of egg soup, saying he was too busy."
            },
            {
                "progress":35,
                "logText":"Milena was too preoccupied with her deer soup to make egg soup."
            },
            {
                "progress":36,
                "logText":"Crescenzio said soups aren't part of Brightport's cuisine, so he won't cook it for me."
            },
            {
                "progress":37,
