            },
            {
                "progress":40,
                "logText":"Kendelow in Remgard agreed to make a pot of egg soup."
            },
            {
                "progress":45,
                "logText":"The cook at the Foaming Flask agreed to make a pot of egg soup on the condition that I try a sip of anklebiter soup."
            },
            {
